# automation/: ship only the helper scripts the container actually runs.
# Secrets and host-local state must NOT be baked into the image — they are
# delivered via K8s secrets (kiwoom-watcher-env, multica-cli-config) and PVCs.
automation/discord_webhook_url
automation/memory*.md
automation/eligible_carryover_*.json
automation/*.bak

# docs/site 빌드 도구·산출물 — 이미지에 안 들어가지만 빌드 컨텍스트가 커진다
docs/site/.venv
docs/site/.build
